{"4786070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axeponential", "steam_appid": 4786070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/d210bda38c56c5a6e2009aad299b2626.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/d210bda38c56c5a6e2009aad299b2626.webm?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/d210bda38c56c5a6e2009aad299b2626.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your axe and start <strong>chopping</strong>! <br><strong>Axeponential</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game about a lumberjack on a journey to find the legendary Tree of Life and gain immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/f09b4cb9a68d3e327d9320426e40a847.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/f09b4cb9a68d3e327d9320426e40a847.webm?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/f09b4cb9a68d3e327d9320426e40a847.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down all kinds of trees, collect pinecones and acorns, and sell your resources to earn money. <br>From giant ancient trees to strange magical forests, every area has new materials to discover and harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/2f09f0830a61a4ffeacbb41f516e78db.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/2f09f0830a61a4ffeacbb41f516e78db.webm?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/2f09f0830a61a4ffeacbb41f516e78db.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to upgrade your axe, tools, truck, and camp. <br>Gather rare resources, unlock new skills, and become a faster and stronger lumberjack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.webm?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different forests, uncover ancient secrets, and travel deeper into the wilderness. Somewhere beyond the trees, the Tree of Life is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/d210bda38c56c5a6e2009aad299b2626.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=212 ><source src=\"https://sh