em_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/2f09f0830a61a4ffeacbb41f516e78db.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to upgrade your axe, tools, truck, and camp. <br>Gather rare resources, unlock new skills, and become a faster and stronger lumberjack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.poster.avif?t=1781269960\" width=512 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.webm?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/extras/603607ba7855ab0b7119aa00f517d995.mp4?t=1781269960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different forests, uncover ancient secrets, and travel deeper into the wilderness. Somewhere beyond the trees, the Tree of Life is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Swing your axe and start your adventure in this cozy incremental game about a lumberjack on a quest for immortality. Harvest trees, collect resources, upgrade your tools, and explore mysterious forests in search of the Tree of Life.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/d74d537c321039a1cd63b75b52fb13c492f33045/header.jpg?t=1781269960", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/2c074b51c23fe8678ca81e975bb0787d44a15c98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781269960", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786070/2c074b51c23fe8678ca81e975bb0787d44a15c98/c